    "$t": "324期封面作品—1947.3.13 湯德章"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjUu-EAtZ2wS6XkF3xFs3c6J7XSJ84O_blfr8P9hakRCkpFo4piLGZfnJ7C4P4IzXpiiuxQpvGyvPvcIZZKJqviG7fo1Tuphvi6TAAkDMYryIvsvJjaKn5Z2AAje3IuvfDYRdvIyEyZJZG5/s2048/%25E5%25B0%2581%25E5%25BA%2595%25E5%259C%2596.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1729\" data-original-width=\"2048\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjUu-EAtZ2wS6XkF3xFs3c6J7XSJ84O_blfr8P9hakRCkpFo4piLGZfnJ7C4P4IzXpiiuxQpvGyvPvcIZZKJqviG7fo1Tuphvi6TAAkDMYryIvsvJjaKn5Z2AAje3IuvfDYRdvIyEyZJZG5/w640-h540/%25E5%25B0%2581%25E5%25BA%2595%25E5%259C%2596.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><b><br /></b><p></p><p><b>作品名稱</b></p><p>1947.3.13 湯德章</p><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><p><b>冊ê簡介</b></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>ISBN：9789571385310</p><p><br /></p><p>https://reurl.cc/4ylnDR</p><p><br /></p><p><b>封面圖作者：</b>蠢羊</p><p><br /></p><p><b>作者簡介：</b>台灣藝術大學美術系畢業，bat擔任《沃草》美編。尪仔冊作品有《火人》、《菜比巴警鴿成長日記》、《棒球人生賽（1~4）》（連載中）。</p><p><br /></p><p>FB迷眾頁： 蠢羊與奇怪生物。</p><p><br /></p><p><b>封面圖簡介：</b>「台灣人，萬歲！」Tse是湯德章律師1947年3月13 ，hōo tuì中國走來台灣ê國民政府軍人，無經過審判就公開銃殺進前，用日語hán-huah ê遺言。</p><p><br /></p><p>過去，國民政府kā湯德章當做反亂ê歹人，罵伊是日本人ê透種走狗；tann，台南人講伊是英雄，台南市政府koh kā湯律師hōo人銃殺ê日子定做記念日，呵咾伊ê正義kap勇氣是台灣人bē-tàng放bē記--ê。</p><p><br /></p><p>Tsit張圖是2月份tú出版ê台灣名人傳記《湯德章》台文版尪仔冊其中ê 1張。</p><p><br /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><span face=\"&quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif\"><b>台文通訊BONG報324期，2021年3月出刊。</b></span></div><div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi4zq6MDKJdBj96TxDizLLvl_LX3vYBmbnkDJ4ap8b-HVLuL167HBr34gT2W4vm95ocKPHDON7BG53XotOy4PB4hIcq21XytEMdyezZLVdtKi3HIdIF5OzJeoCKGUYp9v8RXahmd1pwXQec/s1424/324%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"400\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi4zq6MDKJdBj96TxDizLLvl_LX3vYBmbnkDJ4ap8b-HVLuL167HBr34gT2W4vm95ocKPHDON7BG53XotOy4PB4hIcq21XytEMdyezZLVdtKi3HIdIF5OzJeoCKGUYp9v8RXahmd1pwXQec/w281-h400/324%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" width=\"281\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><b><br /></b></div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\"><b>歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　</b></span></div><div><b><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></b></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\"><b>線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvM